## SH2 — One hop question -> answer: fetching body after Top-k (stack_history has much more text)
traits: start=filtered scan hops=1 fan-out=low Top-10 | R0 output: q.post_id | R1 start: q.score | R6 aggregate / sort: a.score, a.post_id | R7 text: a.body

### SH2 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(q.post_id, a.post_id, a.body)
  : Projection[q.post_id, a.post_id, a.body]
  :   GetProperty(a.body) [node:Post]
  :     GetProperty(q.post_id) [node:Post]
  :       Limit[10]
  :         Sort[_sort0 DESC, a.post_id ASC]
  :           Projection[a.post_id, a.score AS _sort0, a, q]
  :             GetProperty(a.score) [node:Post]
  :               GetProperty(a.post_id) [node:Post]
  :                 Expand((q)-[_r0:PARENT_OF]->(a:Post))
  :                   Filter((q.score >= 100))
  :                     GetProperty(q.score) [node:Post]
  :                       EntityScan(q:Post)

### SH2 @relational
Coord Projection[q.post_id, a.post_id, a.body]
  Fetch[mysql] in=(a) out=(a, a.body)
    : GetProperty(a.body) [node:Post]
    :   Argument(a)
    Fetch[mysql] in=(q) out=(q, q.post_id)
      : GetProperty(q.post_id) [node:Post]
      :   Argument(q)
      Coord Limit[10]
        Coord Sort[_sort0 DESC, a.post_id ASC]
          Coord Projection[a.post_id, a.score AS _sort0, a, q]
            Fetch[mysql] in=(a) out=(a, a.post_id, a.score)
              : GetProperty(a.score) [node:Post]
              :   GetProperty(a.post_id) [node:Post]
              :     Argument(a)
              StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(q) out=(q, a)
                : Expand((q)-[_r0:PARENT_OF]->(a:Post))
                :   Argument(q)
                StoreQuery[mysql] out=(q)
                  : Filter((q.score >= 100))
                  :   GetProperty(q.score) [node:Post]
                  :     EntityScan(q:Post)

