## SH3 — Two hops over sparse links: placing the middle condition (the small fan-out control)
traits: start=filtered scan hops=2 fan-out=low aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: q.score | R3 middle: m.view_count | R6 aggregate / sort: r.post_id

### SH3 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(r.post_id, links)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[links DESC, r.post_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: r.post_id | count(*) AS links]
  :       GetProperty(r.post_id) [node:Post]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
  :           Expand((m)-[_r1:LINKS_TO]->(r:Post))
  :             Filter((m.view_count >= 1000))
  :               GetProperty(m.view_count) [node:Post]
  :                 Expand((q)-[_r0:LINKS_TO]->(m:Post))
  :                   Filter((q.score >= 5))
  :                     GetProperty(q.score) [node:Post]
  :                       EntityScan(q:Post)

### SH3 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[links DESC, r.post_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: r.post_id | count(*) AS links]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(r) out=(r, r.post_id)
        : GetProperty(r.post_id) [node:Post]
        :   Argument(r)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(m) out=(m)
          : Filter((m.view_count >= 1000))
          :   GetProperty(m.view_count) [node:Post]
          :     Argument(m)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(q) out=(q, m, r)
            : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
