## SH4 — One hop plus an aggregation: whether it is absorbed when the aggregated value is off graph
traits: start=filtered scan hops=1 fan-out=low aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: u.reputation | R6 aggregate / sort: u.user_id, p.score, p.view_count

### SH4 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(u.user_id, posts, avgScore, maxViews)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[posts DESC, u.user_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: u.user_id | count(p) AS posts, avg(p.score) AS avgScore, max(p.view_count) AS maxViews]
  :       GetProperty(p.view_count) [node:Post]
  :         GetProperty(p.score) [node:Post]
  :           GetProperty(u.user_id) [node:User]
  :             Expand((u)-[_r0:AUTHORED]->(p:Post))
  :               Filter((u.reputation >= 10000))
  :                 GetProperty(u.reputation) [node:User]
  :                   EntityScan(u:User)

### SH4 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[posts DESC, u.user_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: u.user_id | count(p) AS posts, avg(p.score) AS avgScore, max(p.view_count) AS maxViews]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(p) out=(p, p.score, p.view_count)
        : GetProperty(p.view_count) [node:Post]
        :   GetProperty(p.score) [node:Post]
        :     Argument(p)
        Fetch[mysql] in=(u) out=(u, u.user_id)
          : GetProperty(u.user_id) [node:User]
          :   Argument(u)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(u) out=(u, p)
            : Expand((u)-[_r0:AUTHORED]->(p:Post))
            :   Argument(u)
            StoreQuery[mysql] out=(u)
              : Filter((u.reputation >= 10000))
              :   GetProperty(u.reputation) [node:User]
              :     EntityScan(u:User)

### SH4 @document
