## SH5 — A whole-path condition (none) on the linear chain of versions: the cost of extracting paths
traits: start=filtered scan hops=1..5 fan-out=low variable-length aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: r.creation_date | R4 path: x.history_type | R6 aggregate / sort: o.post_id

### SH5 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(o.post_id, chains)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[chains DESC, o.post_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: o.post_id | count(*) AS chains]
  :       GetProperty(o.post_id) [node:Rev]
  :         Filter(NOT((o.history_type = 8)))
  :           GetProperty(o.history_type) [node:Rev]
  :             VarLengthExpand((r)-[_r0:PREV_EDIT*1..5]->(o:Rev)) seg[all(x IN nodes WHERE NOT((x.history_type = 8)))]
  :               Filter(NOT((r.history_type = 8)))
  :                 GetProperty(r.history_type) [node:Rev]
  :                   Filter((r.creation_date >= "2020-01-01"))
  :                     GetProperty(r.creation_date) [node:Rev]
  :                       EntityScan(r:Rev)

### SH5 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[chains DESC, o.post_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: o.post_id | count(*) AS chains]
      StoreQuery[mysql] in=(o) out=(o, o.post_id)
        : GetProperty(o.post_id) [node:Rev]
        :   Filter(NOT((o.history_type = 8)))
        :     GetProperty(o.history_type) [node:Rev]
        :       Argument(o)
        Coord Filter(all(x IN nodes(_seg__r0) WHERE NOT((x.history_type = 8))))
          ListFetch[mysql] _seg__r0.nodes.history_type from _seg__r0 [elem:Rev]
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(r) out=(r, _seg__r0, o)
              : VarLengthExpand((r)-[_r0:PREV_EDIT*1..5]->(o:Rev)) emit _seg__r0
              :   Argument(r)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(r)
                : Filter(NOT((r.history_type = 8)))
                :   GetProperty(r.history_type) [node:Rev]
                :     Filter((r.creation_date >= "2020-01-01"))
                :       GetProperty(r.creation_date) [node:Rev]
                :         EntityScan(r:Rev)

