## SH6 — Fetching version text (large in total) after Top-k, and the effect of a smaller graph
traits: start=filtered scan hops=2 fan-out=low Top-10 | R0 output: p.post_id | R1 start: u.reputation | R2 end: p.score | R6 aggregate / sort: r.creation_date, r.rev_id | R7 text: r.text

### SH6 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(p.post_id, r.rev_id, r.text)
  : Projection[p.post_id, r.rev_id, r.text]
  :   GetProperty(r.text) [node:Rev]
  :     GetProperty(p.post_id) [node:Post]
  :       Limit[10]
  :         Sort[_sort0 DESC, r.rev_id ASC]
  :           Projection[r.rev_id, r.creation_date AS _sort0, r, p]
  :             GetProperty(r.creation_date) [node:Rev]
  :               GetProperty(r.rev_id) [node:Rev]
  :                 Filter((p.score >= 50))
  :                   GetProperty(p.score) [node:Post]
  :                     Expand((r)<-[_r1:HAS_EDIT]-(p:Post))
  :                       Expand((u)-[_r0:MADE_EDIT]->(r:Rev))
  :                         Filter((u.reputation >= 10000))
  :                           GetProperty(u.reputation) [node:User]
  :                             EntityScan(u:User)

### SH6 @relational
Coord Projection[p.post_id, r.rev_id, r.text]
  Fetch[mysql] in=(r) out=(r, r.text)
    : GetProperty(r.text) [node:Rev]
    :   Argument(r)
    Fetch[mysql] in=(p) out=(p, p.post_id)
      : GetProperty(p.post_id) [node:Post]
      :   Argument(p)
      Coord Limit[10]
        Coord Sort[_sort0 DESC, r.rev_id ASC]
          Coord Projection[r.rev_id, r.creation_date AS _sort0, r, p]
            Fetch[mysql] in=(r) out=(r, r.creation_date, r.rev_id)
              : GetProperty(r.creation_date) [node:Rev]
              :   GetProperty(r.rev_id) [node:Rev]
              :     Argument(r)
              StoreQuery[mysql] in=(p) out=(p)
                : Filter((p.score >= 50))
                :   GetProperty(p.score) [node:Post]
                :     Argument(p)
                StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(u) out=(u, p, r)
                  : Expand((r)<-[_r1:HAS_EDIT]-(p:Post))
                  :   Expand((u)-[_r0:MADE_EDIT]->(r:Rev))
                  :     Argument(u)
                  StoreQuery[mysql] out=(u)
                    : Filter((u.reputation >= 10000))
                    :   GetProperty(u.reputation) [node:User]
                    :     EntityScan(u:User)

